<title>PHILIPPINES: PCI Leasing Q1 net 79.64 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>PCI Leasing Q1 net 79.64 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>PCI Leasing and Finance Inc said on Wednesday its net income in the first quarter ended March amounted to 79.64 million pesos.</p>
<p>The firm, a unit of Philippine Commercial International Bank, did not give a comparative year-ago figure.</p>
<p>It said total income was 272.20 million pesos while expenses amounted to 168.14 million.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8934</p>
</text>
